00:20:14.146 --> 00:20:28.527 size:53% position:73% line:53%
transport en commun.

00:20:21.387 --> 00:20:29.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'accès à la propriété pour

00:20:22.588 --> 00:20:30.929 size:53% position:73% line:53%
