00:21:53.212 --> 00:21:58.550 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ou en santé.

00:21:56.215 --> 00:21:59.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JAMES RANKIN,

00:21:57.416 --> 00:22:00.986 size:53% position:73% line:53%
résident de Vancouver

00:21:58.651 --> 00:22:02.187 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On se cherche des... aussi des

00:21:59.852 --> 00:22:03.422 size:53% position:73% line:53%
