00:22:12.064 --> 00:22:15.601 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Donc ça rend la difficile pour

00:22:13.265 --> 00:22:24.276 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nous, mais affecte aussi tout

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:29.114 size:53% position:73% line:53%
