00:22:15.701 --> 00:22:30.316 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de nous.

00:22:24.376 --> 00:22:35.154 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Depuis plusieurs années, lors

00:22:29.214 --> 00:22:36.388 size:53% position:73% line:53%
