00:22:35.254 --> 00:22:42.428 size:53% position:73% line:53%
important pour des millions de

00:22:36.488 --> 00:22:43.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Canadiens. L'accès Internet

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:49.668 size:53% position:73% line:53%
haute vitesse.

00:22:42.528 --> 00:22:50.869 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il y a plusieurs Canadiens qui

00:22:43.729 --> 00:22:52.070 size:53% position:73% line:53%
