00:22:49.768 --> 00:22:55.708 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vitesse. Dans les milieux

00:22:50.969 --> 00:22:56.909 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ruraux, un Canadien sur cinq à

00:22:52.171 --> 00:22:58.110 size:53% position:73% line:53%
