00:30:49.781 --> 00:31:00.058 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Justin Trudeau pense que le

00:30:51.516 --> 00:31:00.926 size:53% position:73% line:53%
budget va satisfaire les

00:30:53.218 --> 00:31:06.998 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Canadiens. Les conservateurs

00:31:00.158 --> 00:31:07.866 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne vont pas rester les bras

00:31:01.026 --> 00:31:08.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
