00:31:12.270 --> 00:31:15.607 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre Justin Trudeau et de

00:31:13.138 --> 00:31:16.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son ministre des finances Bill

00:31:14.005 --> 00:31:17.342 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Morneau il y a quelques secondes

00:31:15.707 --> 00:31:24.282 size:53% position:73% line:53%
