00:31:34.793 --> 00:31:44.169 size:53% position:73% line:53%
achat des autos électriques,

00:31:42.534 --> 00:31:45.003 size:53% position:73% line:53%
assurance médicaments, accès à

00:31:43.401 --> 00:31:46.738 size:53% position:73% line:53%
